        "source_pdf=plant_database/references/New Hampshire/UNH Day-neutral Strawberries for Northern New England.pdf | cited_source=Low tunnel strawberries PDF. Cornell fruit program | url=http://hort.cornell.edu/fruit/pdfs/low-tunnel-strawberries.pdf | scanner_kind=visible_url_context | notes=Potential northeast day-neutral strawberry production and cultivar support source",
